#: data_templates.php
msgid "WARNING: This change will not change either the step or the heartbeat of existing RRDfiles.  After this change, a Rebuild Poller Cache operation will take place in background to update the data collection cycle for the impacted Data Sources.  It is strongly suggested that you either delete all the impacted RRDfiles afterwards, or use the splice_rrd.php CLI script to preserve old data and repopulate the new RRDfiles with the legacy data.  Otherwise, this change will have no on the data and may in fact lead to a loss of fidelity if you are increasing the time between data collection cycles."
msgstr "GARGAƊI: Wannan canjin ba zai canza mataki (step) ko bugun zuciya (heartbeat) na RRDfiles da ke akwai ba.  Bayan wannan canjin, za a gudanar da aikin Sake Gina Taskar Mai Tattara Bayanai a baya don sabunta zagayen tattara bayanai na Tusoshin Bayanai da abin ya shafa.  Ana ba da shawara sosai cewa ko dai ka goge dukkan RRDfiles da abin ya shafa bayan haka, ko kuma ka yi amfani da rubutun CLI na splice_rrd.php don adana tsofaffin bayanai da sake cika sababbin RRDfiles da tsofaffin bayanan.  In ba haka ba, wannan canjin ba zai yi tasiri a kan bayanan ba kuma yana iya haifar da asarar daidaito idan kana ƙara lokaci tsakanin zagayen tattara bayanai."

