#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter a name for this GPRINT preset, make sure it is something you recognize."
msgstr "Shigar da suna don wannan saitin GPRINT da aka riga aka saita, tabbatar wani abu ne da za ka gane."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Text"
msgstr "Rubutun GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Enter the custom GPRINT string here."
msgstr "Shigar da kirtanin GPRINT na musamman a nan."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Common Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Gama-gari"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Title (--title)"
msgstr "Take (--title)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Cacti documentation."
msgstr "Sunan da aka buga a kan jadawalin. Zai iya haɗawa da masu canjin maye gurbin kamar |host_description| ko |query_fieldName|. Don cikakken jerin alamun maye gurbin da ake tallafawa, da fatan za a duba takardun bayanan Cacti."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label (--vertical-label)"
msgstr "Alamar Tsaye (--vertical-label)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label vertically printed to the left of the graph."
msgstr "Alamar da aka buga a tsaye a gefen hagu na jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Image Format (--imgformat)"
msgstr "Tsarin Hoto (--imgformat)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Nau'in jadawalin da ake samarwa; PNG, GIF ko SVG. Zaɓin nau'in hoton jadawali ya dogara sosai da RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Height (--height)"
msgstr "Tsawo (--height)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The height (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Tsayin (a cikin pixels) na yankin zane a cikin jadawalin. Wannan yankin ba ya haɗa da maɓallin bayani, bayanan gatura, ko take."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Width (--width)"
msgstr "Faɗi (--width)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Faɗin (a cikin pixels) na yankin zane a cikin jadawalin. Wannan yankin ba ya haɗa da maɓallin bayani, bayanan gatura, ko take."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Base Value (--base)"
msgstr "Ƙimar Tushe (--base)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Should be set to 1024 for memory and 1000 for traffic measurements."
msgstr "Ya kamata a saita shi zuwa 1024 don ƙwaƙwalwar ajiya da 1000 don auna zirga-zirga."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Vertical Label Angle (--vertical-label-angle)"
msgstr "Kusurwar Lakabin Tsaye (--vertical-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "RRDtool Default"
msgstr "Na Asali na RRDtool"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank uses the RRDtool default. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Juyawar lakabi a digiri sabanin agogo. Yana buƙatar RRDtool 1.11 ko sabo. Barin fanko yana amfani da na asali na RRDtool. Kusurwoyi ban da 90 da 270 na iya hawa kan abubuwan da ke kusa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Slope Mode (--slope-mode)"
msgstr "Yanayin Gangare (--slope-mode)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Using Slope Mode evens out the shape of the graphs at the expense of some on screen resolution."
msgstr "Amfani da Yanayin Gangare yana daidaita siffar jadawalan amma yana rage kaɗan daga ƙudurin allo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Scaling Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Sikeli"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale"
msgstr "Sikeli ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto scale the y-axis instead of defining an upper and lower limit. Note: if this is check both the Upper and Lower limit will be ignored."
msgstr "Daidaita sikelin gatar y ta atomatik maimakon ayyana iyakar sama da ƙasa. Lura: idan an zaɓi wannan za a yi watsi da iyakar Sama da ta Ƙasa duka."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Scale Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Sikeli ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Yi amfani da <br> --alt-autoscale don daidaita sikeli zuwa mafi ƙanƙanta da mafi girma gaba ɗaya <br> --alt-autoscale-max don daidaita sikeli zuwa ƙima mafi girma, ta amfani da iyakar ƙasa da aka bayar <br> --alt-autoscale-min don daidaita sikeli zuwa ƙima mafi ƙanƙanta, ta amfani da iyakar sama da aka bayar <br> --alt-autoscale (tare da iyakoki) don daidaita sikeli ta amfani da iyakokin ƙasa da sama duka (na asali na RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (ignoring given limits)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale (ba tare da la'akari da iyakokin da aka bayar ba)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-max (accepting a lower limit)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale-max (karɓar iyakar ƙasa)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale-min (accepting an upper limit)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale-min (karɓar iyakar sama)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits, RRDtool default)"
msgstr "Yi amfani da --alt-autoscale (karɓar iyakokin biyu, na asali na RRDtool)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Logarithmic Scaling (--logarithmic)"
msgstr "Sikeli na Logaritim (--logarithmic)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Yi amfani da sikelin gatar y na Logaritim"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling (--units=si)"
msgstr "Rukunin SI don Sikeli na Logaritim (--units=si)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Yi amfani da Rukunin SI don Sikeli na Logaritim maimakon amfani da rubutun exponential.<br> Lura: Jadawalan layi suna amfani da rubutun SI ta asali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Rigid Boundaries Mode (--rigid)"
msgstr "Yanayin Kafaffun Iyakoki (--rigid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Do not expand the lower and upper limit if the graph contains a value outside the valid range."
msgstr "Kada a faɗaɗa iyakar ƙasa da ta sama idan jadawalin yana ɗauke da ƙima da ke wajen ingantaccen zangon."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Upper Limit (--upper-limit)"
msgstr "Iyakar Sama (--upper-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The maximum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Mafi girman ƙimar tsaye don jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Lower Limit (--lower-limit)"
msgstr "Iyakar Ƙasa (--lower-limit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The minimum vertical value for the graph."
msgstr "Mafi ƙanƙantar ƙimar tsaye don jadawalin."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Grid Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Grid"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Grid Value (--unit/--y-grid)"
msgstr "Ƙimar Rukunin Grid (--unit/--y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Sets the exponent value on the Y-axis for numbers. Note: This option is deprecated and replaced by the --y-grid option.  In this option, Y-axis grid lines appear at each grid step interval.  Labels are placed every label factor lines."
msgstr "Yana saita ƙimar exponent akan gatar Y don lambobi. Lura: An daina amfani da wannan zaɓin kuma an maye gurbinsa da zaɓin --y-grid. A cikin wannan zaɓin, layukan grid na gatar Y suna bayyana a kowane tazarar matakin grid. Ana sanya lakabi a kowane layukan ma'aunin lakabi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Exponent Value (--units-exponent)"
msgstr "Ƙimar Exponent na Rukuni (--units-exponent)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "What unit Cacti should use on the Y-axis. Use 3 to display everything in \"k\" or -6 to display everything in \"u\" (micro)."
msgstr "Wane rukuni ya kamata Cacti ya yi amfani da shi akan gatar Y. Yi amfani da 3 don nuna komai a cikin \"k\" ko -6 don nuna komai a cikin \"u\" (micro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Unit Length (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"
msgstr "Tsawon Rukuni (--units-length &lt;length&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How many digits should RRDtool assume the y-axis labels to be? You may have to use this option to make enough space once you start fiddling with the y-axis labeling."
msgstr "Lambobi nawa ya kamata RRDtool ya ɗauka lakabin gatar y suna da su? Wataƙila za ku buƙaci amfani da wannan zaɓin don samar da isasshen sarari da zarar kun fara gyara lakabin gatar y."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "No Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"
msgstr "Babu Gridfit (--no-gridfit)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "In order to avoid anti-aliasing blurring effects RRDtool snaps points to device resolution pixels, this results in a crisper appearance. If this is not to your liking, you can use this switch to turn this behavior off.<br><strong>Note: </strong>Gridfitting is turned off for PDF, EPS, SVG output by default."
msgstr "Domin guje wa dusashewar anti-aliasing RRDtool yana daidaita maki zuwa pixels na ƙudurin na'ura, wannan yana haifar da bayyanar da ta fi kaifi. Idan ba ku son haka, za ku iya amfani da wannan maɓallin don kashe wannan halayyar.<br><strong>Lura: </strong>An kashe daidaita grid (gridfitting) don fitarwar PDF, EPS, SVG ta asali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Alternative Y Grid (--alt-y-grid)"
msgstr "Madadin Grid na Y (--alt-y-grid)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "Tsarin lissafin yana tabbatar da cewa koyaushe kuna da grid, akwai isassun layukan grid amma ba su yi yawa ba, kuma grid ɗin yana kan tsarin metric. Wannan ma'aunin zai kuma tabbatar da cewa an nuna isassun lambobin desimal ko da jadawalin ku ya tashi daga 69.998 zuwa 70.001.<br><strong>Lura: </strong>Wannan ma'aunin na iya yin katsalandan da zaɓuɓɓukan --alt-autoscale."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Axis Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Gatar"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"
msgstr "Gatar Dama (--right-axis &lt;scale:shift&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A second axis will be drawn to the right of the graph. It is tied to the left axis via the scale and shift parameters."
msgstr "Za a zana gatar ta biyu a gefen dama na jadawalin. Tana da alaƙa da gatar hagu ta hanyar ma'aunan sikeli da motsawa (scale da shift)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"
msgstr "Lakabin Gatar Dama (--right-axis-label &lt;string&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The label for the right axis."
msgstr "Lakabin gatar dama."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Angle (--right-axis-label-angle)"
msgstr "Kusurwar Lakabin Gatar Dama (--right-axis-label-angle)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right label rotation in degrees counter clockwise. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank follows the vertical label angle. Angles other than 90 and 270 may overlap nearby content."
msgstr "Juyawar lakabin dama a digiri sabanin agogo. Yana buƙatar RRDtool 1.11 ko sabo. Barin fanko yana bin kusurwar lakabin tsaye. Kusurwoyi ban da 90 da 270 na iya hawa kan abubuwan da ke kusa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Label Range (--right-axis-range)"
msgstr "Zangon Lakabin Gatar Dama (--right-axis-range)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Only show right axis labels within min:max, for example 0:100. Either bound may be blank. This does not change the axis scale. Requires RRDtool 1.11 or newer. Blank leaves labels unrestricted."
msgstr "Nuna lakabin gatar dama kawai a cikin min:max, misali 0:100. Kowane iyaka na iya zama fanko. Wannan ba ya canza sikelin gatar. Yana buƙatar RRDtool 1.11 ko sabo. Barin fanko yana barin lakabi ba tare da ƙuntatawa ba."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Format (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Tsarin Gatar Dama (--right-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
#, php-format
msgid "By default, the format of the axis labels gets determined automatically.  If you want to do this yourself, use this option with the same %lf arguments you know from the PRINT and GPRINT commands."
msgstr "Ta tsohuwa, ana ƙayyade tsarin alamun axis da kansa.  Idan kana son yin wannan da kanka, yi amfani da wannan zaɓi tare da sigogin %lf iri ɗaya da ka sani daga umarnin PRINT da GPRINT."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Right Axis Formatter (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Mai Tsara Axis na Dama (--right-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Lokacin da kake saita alamun axis na dama, sanya ƙa'ida ga tsarin bayanai.  Tsare-tsaren da ake goyon baya sun haɗa da \"numeric\" inda ake ɗaukar bayanai a matsayin lambobi, \"timestamp\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin tambarin lokaci na UNIX (yawan daƙiƙu tun daga Janairu 1970) kuma ana bayyana su ta amfani da tsarin strftime (na tsohuwa shine \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Duba kuma --units-length da --right-axis-format.  A ƙarshe \"duration\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin tsawon lokaci a cikin millisekond.  Tsarawa yana bin ƙa'idodin PRINT/GPRINT masu cancantar valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Format (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"
msgstr "Tsarin Axis na Hagu (--left-axis-format &lt;format&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Left Axis Formatter (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"
msgstr "Mai Tsara Axis na Hagu (--left-axis-formatter &lt;formatname&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Lokacin da kake saita alamun axis na hagu, sanya ƙa'ida ga tsarin bayanai.  Tsare-tsaren da ake goyon baya sun haɗa da \"numeric\" inda ake ɗaukar bayanai a matsayin lambobi, \"timestamp\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin tambarin lokaci na UNIX (yawan daƙiƙu tun daga Janairu 1970) kuma ana bayyana su ta amfani da tsarin strftime (na tsohuwa shine \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Duba kuma --units-length.  A ƙarshe \"duration\" inda ake fassara ƙimomi a matsayin tsawon lokaci a cikin millisekond.  Tsarawa yana bin ƙa'idodin PRINT/GPRINT masu cancantar valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Options"
msgstr "Zaɓuɓɓukan Bayanin Jadawali"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Auto Padding"
msgstr "Cika Tazarar Kai Tsaye"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Pad text so that legend and graph data always line up. Note: this could cause graphs to take longer to render because of the larger overhead. Also Auto Padding may not be accurate on all types of graphs, consistent labeling usually helps."
msgstr "Cika rubutu domin bayanin jadawali da bayanan jadawalin su riƙa daidaitawa a kowane lokaci. Lura: wannan zai iya sa jadawalan su ɗauki lokaci mai tsawo wajen ginawa saboda ƙarin nauyin aiki. Haka kuma Cika Tazarar Kai Tsaye bazai yi daidai a kan dukkan nau'ikan jadawali ba, sanya alamu iri ɗaya akai-akai yana taimakawa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Dynamic Labels (--dynamic-labels)"
msgstr "Alamu Masu Canzawa (--dynamic-labels)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Draw line markers as a line."
msgstr "Zana alamun layi a matsayin layi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force Rules Legend (--force-rules-legend)"
msgstr "Tilasta Bayanin Jadawali na Ƙa'idodi (--force-rules-legend)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Force the generation of HRULE and VRULE legends."
msgstr "Tilasta samar da bayanan jadawali na HRULE da VRULE."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Tab Width (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"
msgstr "Faɗin Shafin Tab (--tabwidth &lt;pixels&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "By default the tab-width is 40 pixels, use this option to change it."
msgstr "Ta tsohuwa faɗin tab shine pixels 40, yi amfani da wannan zaɓi don canza shi."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Position (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"
msgstr "Matsayin Bayanin Jadawali (--legend-position=&lt;position&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend at the given side of the graph."
msgstr "Sanya bayanin jadawali a gefen jadawalin da aka bayar."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Legend Direction (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"
msgstr "Alƙiblar Bayanin Jadawali (--legend-direction=&lt;direction&gt;)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Place the legend items in the given vertical order."
msgstr "Sanya abubuwan bayanin jadawali a cikin tsarin tsaye da aka bayar."

#: include/global_form.php lib/api_aggregate.php
msgid "Graph Item Type"
msgstr "Nau'in Abin Jadawali"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented visually on the graph."
msgstr "Yadda ake nuna bayanan wannan abu a gani a kan jadawali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The data source to use for this graph item."
msgstr "Tushen bayanai da za a yi amfani da shi don wannan abin jadawali."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Primary Color"
msgstr "Launi na Farko"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The color to use for the canvas item and legend."
msgstr "Launin da za a yi amfani da shi don abin zane da bayanin jadawali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Primary Opacity"
msgstr "Bayyanar Launi na Farko"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the primary color."
msgstr "Bayyanar launi na farko."

#: include/global_form.php lib/html.php
msgid "Gradient Color"
msgstr "Launi Mai Sauyawa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The gradient color to use for the canvas item."
msgstr "Launi mai sauyawa da za a yi amfani da shi don abin zane."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Opacity"
msgstr "Bayyanar Launi Mai Sauyawa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The opacity of the gradient color."
msgstr "Bayyanar launi mai sauyawa."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Gradient Height"
msgstr "Tsayin Launi Mai Sauyawa"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The Gradient Height parameter can create three different behaviors. If it is > 0, then the gradient is a fixed height, starting at the line going down. If it is < 0, then the gradient starts at a fixed height above the x-axis, going down to the x-axis. If it is == 0, then the gradient goes from the top of the area fill to x-axis."
msgstr "Siffar Tsayin Launi Mai Sauyawa na iya haifar da halaye guda uku daban-daban. Idan ya kasance > 0, to launi mai sauyawar yana da tsayayyen tsawo, yana farawa daga layin yana sauka ƙasa. Idan ya kasance < 0, to launi mai sauyawar yana farawa ne a wani tsayayyen tsawo sama da x-axis, yana sauka zuwa x-axis. Idan ya kasance == 0, to launi mai sauyawar yana tafiya daga saman cikar yankin zuwa x-axis."

#: include/global_form.php lib/rrd.php
msgid "Consolidation Function"
msgstr "Aikin Haɗa Bayanai"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "How data for this item is represented statistically on the graph."
msgstr "Yadda ake wakiltar bayanan wannan abu ta hanyar ƙididdiga a kan jadawali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "CDEF Function"
msgstr "Aikin CDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A CDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph or legend."
msgstr "Aikin CDEF (lissafi) da za a yi amfani da shi ga wannan abu a kan jadawali ko bayanin jadawali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "VDEF Function"
msgstr "Aikin VDEF"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "A VDEF (math) function to apply to this item on the graph legend."
msgstr "Aikin VDEF (lissafi) da za a yi amfani da shi ga wannan abu a kan bayanin jadawali."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Shift Data"
msgstr "Matsar da Bayanai"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Offset your data on the time axis (x-axis) by the amount specified in the 'value' field."
msgstr "Matsar da bayananka a kan axis na lokaci (x-axis) da adadin da aka ƙayyade a cikin filin 'value'."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "[HRULE|VRULE]: The value of the graph item.<br/> [TICK]: The fraction for the tick line.<br/> [SHIFT]: The time offset in seconds."
msgstr "[HRULE|VRULE]: Ƙimar abin jadawalin.<br/> [TICK]: Kason layin alamar tick.<br/> [SHIFT]: Matsayin canjin lokaci a cikin daƙiƙu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "GPRINT Type"
msgstr "Nau'in GPRINT"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "If this graph item is a GPRINT, you can optionally choose another format here. You can define additional types under \"GPRINT Presets\"."
msgstr "Idan wannan abin jadawalin GPRINT ne, zaka iya zaɓar wani tsari daban anan idan kana so. Zaka iya ayyana ƙarin nau'ika a ƙarƙashin \"GPRINT Presets\"."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Alignment (TEXTALIGN)"
msgstr "Daidaita Rubutu (TEXTALIGN)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "All subsequent legend line(s) will be aligned as given here.  You may use this command multiple times in a single graph.  This command does not produce tabular layout.<br/><strong>Note: </strong>You may want to insert a &lt;HR&gt; on the preceding graph item.<br/> <strong>Note: </strong>A &lt;HR&gt; on this legend line will obsolete this setting!"
msgstr "Dukkan layukan bayanin jadawali na gaba za a daidaita su kamar yadda aka bayar anan.  Zaka iya amfani da wannan umarni sau da yawa a cikin jadawali guda.  Wannan umarni baya samar da tsarin tebur.<br/><strong>Lura: </strong>Kana iya son saka &lt;HR&gt; a kan abin jadawalin da ya gabata.<br/> <strong>Lura: </strong>Saka &lt;HR&gt; a kan wannan layin bayanin jadawalin zai soke wannan saitin!"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Text Format"
msgstr "Tsarin Rubutu"

#: include/global_form.php
