#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyi huɗu na tantance Izinin Jadawalin Mai Amfani. Ta farko ita ce 'Mai Sauƙi'. A ƙarƙashin saitin 'Mai Sauƙi', Mai Amfani yana buƙatar samun damar shiga ko dai Jadawalin, Na'urar, ko Samfurin Jadawalin ne kawai domin samun damar duba Jadawalan da suka shafe shi. A ƙarƙashin 'Mai Tsanani', dole ne Mai Amfani ya kasance yana da damar shiga Jadawalin, Na'urar, da kuma Samfurin Jadawalin domin samun damar duba Jadawalin. Waɗannan hanyoyin biyu na farko suna da matsalar faɗaɗawa ga manyan shigarwa sosai. Saboda haka, akwai ƙarin zaɓuɓɓuka guda biyu. Su ne 'Dangane da Na'ura', wanda ke nufin idan kana da damar shiga Na'urar, za ka samu damar duba Jadawalanta. Kuma na ƙarshe shi ne 'Dangane da Samfurin Jadawali', wanda ke nufin idan kana da damar shiga 'Samfurin Jadawali', za ka samu damar duba dukkan Jadawalan Na'ura na wannan Samfurin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Mai Sauƙi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Mai Tsanani"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Dangane da Na'ura"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Ƙirƙirar Jadawali/Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Idan aka saita zuwa Sauƙaƙƙe, za a iya ƙirƙirar Jadawalai da Tushen Bayanai ta hanyar Sabbin Jadawalai kawai. Idan aka saita zuwa Ci-gaba, ana goyon bayan tsohuwar hanyar ƙirƙirar Jadawali da Tushen Bayanai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Simple"
msgstr "Sauƙaƙƙe"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Advanced"
msgstr "Ci-gaba"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Show Form/Setting Help Inline"
msgstr "Nuna Taimakon Fom/Saiti a Cikin Layi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, Form and Setting Help will be show inline.  Otherwise it will be presented when hovering over the help button."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, za a nuna Taimakon Fom da Saiti kai tsaye a cikin layi. In ba haka ba, za a nuna shi ne idan aka ɗora linzami a kan maɓallin taimako."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Local Page Help Only"
msgstr "Taimakon Shafi na Gida Kawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default Cacti page help is located at docs.cacti.net.  However, if your system does not have access to the Internet, you may download the documentation locally in HTML format and host it in the 'docs' location of you Cacti server.  If you choose only to leverage the local location for page help documentation, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Ta tsohuwa, taimakon shafin Cacti yana a docs.cacti.net. Duk da haka, idan tsarinka ba shi da damar shiga Intanet, za ka iya sauke takardun bayanan a gida a tsarin HTML sannan ka ajiye su a wurin 'docs' na uwar garken Cacti naka. Idan ka zaɓi yin amfani da wurin na gida kawai don takardun taimakon shafi, zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Deletion Verification"
msgstr "Tabbatar da Sharewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Prompt user before item deletion."
msgstr "Tambayi mai amfani kafin a share abu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Preservation Preset"
msgstr "Tsarin Kiyaye Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Idan aka kunna, Cacti zai saita Maɓallin Zaɓi don Share Tushen Bayanai masu alaƙa da Jadawali yayin cire Jadawalai. Lura: Cacti ba zai ba da izinin cire Tushen Bayanai ba idan ana amfani da su a wasu Jadawalai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Buɗe Jadawalai da Kansu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Idan aka kunna, Cacti ba zai kulle Jadawalai ba. Wannan yana ba da damar yin gyara da hannu cikin sauri ga Tushen Bayanai masu alaƙa da Jadawali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Ɓoye Allon Kulawa na Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Don amfani da Tallafin Haɗin Waje na Cacti. Ta amfani da wannan saitin, za ka iya ɓoye Allon Kulawa na Cacti, domin ka nuna shafinka kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Kunna Ja-ka-Saka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Wasu fuskokin Cacti suna goyon bayan Ja-ka-Saka. Idan aka zaɓa, za a kunna wannan zaɓin. Lura: Ga masu amfani da ke da raunin gani, ana iya kashe wannan zaɓin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan API na GitHub/GitLab"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "Asalin URL na Ma'ajiyar API"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Idan kana son samun sabbin sigogin ƙarin manhajoji kai tsaye daga GitHub ko GitLab, shigar da adireshin URL na API na GitHub ko GitLab a nan. Na tsohuwa shi ne https://api.github.com/. Canja wannan kawai idan kana da taka ma'ajiyar da kake kulawa da ita don Ƙarin Manhajojin Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub User Account"
msgstr "Asusun Mai Amfani na GitHub"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The User account that holds your GitHub/GitLab repositories.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Asusun Mai Amfani wanda ke riƙe da ma'ajiyoyinka na GitHub/GitLab. Canja wannan kawai idan kana da taka ma'ajiyar da kake kulawa da ita don Ƙarin Manhajojin Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Personal Access Token"
msgstr "Alamar Shiga ta Kai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub without overly restricted rate limiting, enter your Personal Access Token here."
msgstr "Idan kana son samun sabbin sigogin ƙarin manhajoji kai tsaye daga GitHub ba tare da tsananin takunkumin ƙayyadaddun adadi ba, shigar da Alamar Shiga ta Kai a nan."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Unsafe Plugin Installs"
msgstr "Kunna Shigar da Ƙarin Manhajoji Marasa Aminci"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you would like to allow the installation of Cacti Plugins from their 'develop' branch, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Idan kana son ba da izinin shigar da Ƙarin Manhajojin Cacti daga reshensu na 'develop', zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Package Creation Defaults"
msgstr "Tsoffin Saitunan Ƙirƙirar Kunshi"

#: include/global_settings.php package.php
msgid "Author Name"
msgstr "Sunan Mawallafi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The name of the author that you wish published with the Device Template or Package."
msgstr "Sunan mawallafin da kake son a wallafa tare da Samfurin Na'ura ko Kunshi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Author Email Address"
msgstr "Adireshin Imel na Mawallafi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email address of the author that you wish published with the Device Template or Package."
msgstr "Adireshin imel na mawallafin da kake son a wallafa tare da Samfurin Na'ura ko Kunshi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Template/Package Copyright"
msgstr "Haƙƙin Mallaka na Samfuri/Kunshi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default copyright that you would like to use for your packaged Device Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Tsohon haƙƙin mallaka da kake son amfani da shi don Samfuran Na'urori da Kunshoshinka da aka haɗa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Package/Template Import Defaults"
msgstr "Tsoffin Saitunan Shigo da Kunshi/Samfuri"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Package Location"
msgstr "Wurin Kunshi"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Select the Location of the Packages that you wish to Import."
msgstr "Zaɓi Wurin Kunshoshin da kake son Shigo da su."

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Suggested Value Patterns"
msgstr "Maye Gurbin Tsarin Ƙimomin da Aka Shawarta"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Data Source and Graph Template Suggested Value Records.  Graphs and Data Sources will take on new names after either a Data Query Reindex or by using the forced Replace Suggested Values process."
msgstr "Maye gurbin Bayanan Ƙimomin da Aka Shawarta na Tushen Bayanai da Samfurin Jadawali. Jadawalai da Tushen Bayanai za su ɗauki sabbin sunaye ko dai bayan Sake Fihirisar Tambayar Bayanai ko ta hanyar amfani da tsarin Maye Gurbin Ƙimomin da Aka Shawarta na tilas."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Tsaron Shafi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Tilasta Haɗi ta HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Idan aka zaɓa, duk wani yunƙuri na shiga Cacti za a karkatar da shi zuwa HTTPS domin tabbatar da babban tsaro."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Kariyar JavaScript na Cikin Layi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Yana sarrafa yadda Content-Security-Policy ke taƙaita JavaScript na cikin shafi. HTMX yana riƙe manufar 'unsafe-inline' da duk jigogi da ƙarin kayan aiki na yanzu suka dogara da ita kuma ya yi daidai da halayyar fitowar baya. Ƙaurawar Nonce yana fitar da tsauraran manufar nonce a yanayin bayar da rahoto kawai domin a iya gano rubutun tsari na ainihi da na plugins da ba su dace ba ba tare da lalata fuskar mai amfani ba. Tilasta Nonce yana toshe rubutun tsari da ba su da nonce na buƙatar kuma yana buƙatar CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE ya zama true a cikin include/config.php; idan babu wannan ƙofar kai tsaye, zai ci gaba da kasancewa cikin yanayin bayar da rahoto kawai cikin aminci. Zaɓin None kuma yana ba da damar kiran eval() marar tsaro kuma shi ne zaɓi mafi ƙarancin taƙaitawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Na Asali)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Ƙaurawar Nonce (Bayar da Rahoto Kawai)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Tilasta Nonce (Na Gaba)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI na Rahoton Take Dokar CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Ana amfani da shi a yanayin Ƙaurawar Nonce da Tilasta Nonce. URL inda masu binciken yanar gizo ke tura rahotannin take dokar Content-Security-Policy. A bar shi fanko don amfani da mai sarrafa csp_report.php da ke tare da tsarin ƙarƙashin hanyar URL ta Cacti da aka saita."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Madadin Tushen Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Sunayen yankin yanar gizo da aka raba da sarari waɗanda za a ba da izinin samun dama gare su a wajen Sabar Yanar Gizo da kanta. Wannan yana da muhimmanci ga masu amfani da suka zaɓi yin amfani da CDN, ko shafin karɓar baƙunci. Tushe na iya ƙunsar alamar wildcard misali: *.mydomain.com, ko ƙa'idar sadarwa, misali: https://*.example.com. Waɗannan Madadin Tushe sun haɗa da nau'ikan Hoto, CSS da JavaScript kaɗai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Kunna htmx don sabunta tacewa a wuri guda"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Idan an kunna, ana haɗa mai ɗaukar htmx domin shafukan da suka zaɓa su iya sabunta sakamakon tacewarsu ba tare da sake loda shafin gaba ɗaya ba. A kashe shi kawai idan ƙarin kayan aiki suka yi aiki ba daidai ba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "A kunne (na asali)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "A kashe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Wakilin Nesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Lokacin amfani da Masu Tara Bayanai da yawa, waɗannan su ne Saitunan Sadarwa tsakanin Masu Tara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Tashar TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Tashar TCP da ake amfani da ita don sadarwa da Masu Tara Bayanai na Nesa. Ƙa'idar sadarwar za ta yi daidai da babbar sabar yanar gizo ta Cacti (ko dai HTTP ko HTTPS). A bar ta fanko don amfani da tashoshin asali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Yawan lokacin, a cikin daƙiƙoƙi, da babbar sabar yanar gizo ta Cacti za ta jira amsa daga Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa don samun bayanan Na'urori daban-daban kafin ta watsar da buƙatar. A kan Na'urorin da ke da alaƙa da Masu Tara Bayanai ban da Babban Mai Tara Bayanai na Cacti, dole ne a yi amfani da Wakilin Nesa don tattara bayanan Na'ura."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Tabbatar da Takaddun Shaidar TLS na Wakilin Nesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Buƙaci amintaccen takardar shaida wadda sunanta ya yi daidai da sunan uwar garken Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa. A kashe kawai yayin maye gurbin tsofaffin takaddun shaida masu sa hannun kai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "A'a (Tsohuwar Takardar Shaida Mai Sa Hannun Kai)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Fayil ɗin CA na Wakilin Nesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Cikakkiyar hanyar zaɓi zuwa kunshin PEM CA da ake amfani da shi don tabbatar da takaddun shaidar Mai Tara Bayanai na Nesa. A bar shi fanko don amfani da ma'ajiyar amincewa ta tsarin PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Matakin Adawa Rajista"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Matakin adana rajista don ayyukan sarrafa kansu. Matakan su ne Ƙarami, Matsakaici da Babba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Tilasta Binciken Sarrafa Kansu a Jere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Idan an kunna, Sarrafa Kansu na Cacti zai binciki hanyar sadarwa guda ɗaya a lokaci guda ba a tare ba. Wannan saitin yana iya zama mai amfani lokacin da Sabobin Yanar Gizon ku na Cacti ke da ƙarancin ƙwaƙwalwa don gudanar da binciken Sarrafa Kansu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Kunna Ƙirƙirar Jadawali ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Idan an kashe, Sarrafa Kansu na Cacti ba zai ƙirƙiri wani Jadawali kai tsaye ba. Wannan yana da amfani lokacin da ake gyara saitunan Na'ura don guje wa ƙirƙirar sabbin Jadawalai duk lokacin da kuka adana wani abu. Har yanzu za a iya kiran Dokokin Sarrafa Kansu da hannu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Kunna Ƙirƙirar Abin Bishiya ta Atomatik"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Idan an kashe, Sarrafa Kansu na Cacti ba zai ƙirƙiri wani Abin Bishiya kai tsaye ba. Wannan yana da amfani lokacin da ake gyara saitunan Na'ura ko Jadawali don guje wa ƙirƙirar sabbin Shigarwar Bishiya duk lokacin da kuka adana wani abu. Har yanzu za a iya kiran Dokoki da hannu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Imel ɗin Mai Karɓar Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Adireshin Imel da za a tura Saƙonnin Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansu zuwa gare shi idan ba a ayyana shi a matakin Hanyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kansu ba. Idan an bar wannan filin, ko ƙimar Hanyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kansu fanko, Cacti zai yi amfani da Babban asusun Imel na Masu Gudanarwar Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Sunan Mai Aika Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Sunan Imel da za a yi amfani da shi don Saƙonnin Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansu idan ba a ayyana shi a matakin Hanyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kansu ba. Idan an bar wannan filin, ko ƙimar Hanyar Sadarwa ta Sarrafa Kansu fanko, Cacti zai yi amfani da tsohon Sunan Mai Aikawa na tsarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Imel ɗin Mai Aika Sanarwar Sarrafa Kansu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Adireshin Imel da za a yi amfani da shi don Imel ɗin Sanarwa na Automation idan ba a ƙayyade shi a matakin Automation Network ba. Idan an bar wannan filin, ko ƙimar Automation Network fanko, Cacti zai yi amfani da tsohon Adireshin Imel na Aikawa na tsarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Tsoffin Saitunan Samfurin Jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Tushen Bayanai na Gwajin Samfurin Jadawali"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Zaɓi wannan akwatin zaɓi idan kana son gwada Tushen Bayanai kafin a ƙirƙire su don sabbin Samfuran Jadawali da waɗanda aka shigo da su kwanan nan. Tare da kunna Gwajin Tushen Bayanai, idan Tushen Bayanai bai dawo da sahihan bayanai ba, ba za a ƙirƙiri Jadawalin ba. Wannan saitin yana da muhimmanci idan kana son samun Samfurin Na'ura na gama-gari wanda zai iya haɗawa da ƙarin Samfuran Jadawali da za a iya amfani da su bisa zaɓi dangane da halayen Na'urar kanta. Lura: Idan kana da rubutun umarni mai ɗaukar lokaci mai tsawo a matsayin Tushen Bayanai, lokacin ƙirƙirar Jadawalan zai ƙaru."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Tsohon Tsarin Hoto da za a yi amfani da shi don duk sabbin Samfuran Jadawali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Height to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Tsohon Tsawon Jadawali da za a yi amfani da shi don duk sabbin Samfuran Jadawali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Graph Width to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Tsohon Faɗin Jadawali da za a yi amfani da shi don duk sabbin Samfuran Jadawali."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "General Defaults"
msgstr "Tsoffin Saitunan Gama-gari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Device Template used on all new Devices."
msgstr "Tsohon Samfurin Na'ura da ake amfani da shi a kan duk sabbin Na'urori."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Site for all new Devices."
msgstr "Tsohon Wuri don duk sabbin Na'urori."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Poller for all new Devices."
msgstr "Tsohon Mai Tattara Bayanai don duk sabbin Na'urori."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Threads"
