#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Kunna MD5 da DES don SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Ƙa'idojin tabbatarwa na MD5 da na sirri na DES tsofaffi ne, masu rauni, kuma ba sa samuwa a kan ginannun PHP da Net-SNMP masu ƙarfi (FIPS). Lokacin da aka kashe su, ana cire MD5 da DES daga jerin zaɓuɓɓukan Ka'idar Tabbatarwa da Sirri ta SNMPv3 da ake nunawa yayin gyara Na'ura da kuma a cikin Zaɓuɓɓukan SNMP na Automation, ana barin ƙa'idojin SHA da AES masu ƙarfi kawai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Kunna Ma'ajin Wucin Gadi na Shaidar Shiga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Tsananta da adana sigogin shaidar shiga na SNMPv3 sau ɗaya a kowane sauyin shaidar shiga domin kowane tsarin mai tattara bayanai ya sake amfani da su maimakon sake gina su a kowace buƙata. Wannan yana ba da ɗan tanadi lokacin tattarawa da shaidun shiga na SNMPv3 ta hanyar fayilolin aiwatarwa na Net-SNMP. Ƙarin php-snmp yana sarrafa mafi yawan karɓar SNMPv3 a cikin tsari kuma yana ƙetare wannan ma'ajin wucin gadi, amma har yanzu ana amfani da fayilolin Net-SNMP (saboda haka wannan ma'ajin wucin gadi) don zagayen SNMP, fitarwar hex, buƙatun da ke saita context ko engine id, da haɗe-haɗen ƙa'idoji waɗanda sigar PHP da ke aiki ba ta goyan baya ba. Kunna wannan idan kana tattara kowane ɗayan waɗannan ayyukan da shaidun shiga na SNMPv3."

