msgstr "Tazarar tattara bayanai da ake amfani da ita.  Wannan saitin zai shafi yawan lokutan da ake duba da sabunta RRDfiles.  <strong><u>LURA: Idan ka canza wannan ƙima, dole ne ka sake cika cache na poller.  Rashin yin hakan na iya haifar da asarar bayanai.</u></strong>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "is not a valid choice."
msgstr "ba zaɓi ne mai inganci ba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Cron/Daemon Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Cron/Daemon"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The frequency that the Cacti data collector will be started.  You can use either crontab, a scheduled task (for windows), or the cactid systemd service to control launching the Cacti data collector.  For instructions on using the cactid daemon, review the README.md file in the service directory."
msgstr "Yawan lokacin da za a riƙa fara mai tattara bayanai na Cacti.  Za ka iya amfani da ko dai crontab, aikin da aka tsara (don Windows), ko sabis ɗin systemd na cactid don sarrafa ƙaddamar da mai tattara bayanai na Cacti.  Don umarni kan amfani da cactid daemon, duba fayil ɗin README.md a cikin foldar service."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Balance Process Load"
msgstr "Daidaita Nauyin Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will attempt to balance the load of each poller process by equally distributing poller items per process."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin daidaita nauyin kowane tsarin poller ta hanyar rarraba abubuwan poller daidai wa daida a kowane tsari."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Debug Output Width"
msgstr "Faɗin Fitowar Binciken Kuskure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you choose this option, Cacti will check for output that exceeds Cacti's ability to store it and issue a warning when it finds it."
msgstr "Idan ka zaɓi wannan zaɓin, Cacti zai duba fitarwar da ta wuce ƙarfin Cacti na adana ta kuma ya ba da gargaɗi idan ya same ta."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent Timeout"
msgstr "Ƙarewar Lokacin Wakili na Nesa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Refresh Poller Table Per Cycle"
msgstr "Sabunta Teburin Poller a Kowane Zagaye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This setting is for a single poller systems only to rebuild the poller output table on each polling cycle to prevent the memory table from swapping on very large systems with large databases that could use swap."
msgstr "Wannan saitin na tsarin poller guda ɗaya ne kawai don sake gina teburin fitarwar poller a kowane zagayen tattara bayanai don hana teburin ƙwaƙwalwa yin swap a kan manyan tsare-tsare masu manyan rumbunan bayanai waɗanda za su iya amfani da swap."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collector Replication"
msgstr "Rarraba Kwafin Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Poller Sync Interval"
msgstr "Tazarar Daidaita Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default polling sync interval to use when creating a poller.  This setting will affect how often remote pollers are checked and updated."
msgstr "Tazarar daidaita tattara bayanai ta asali da za a yi amfani da ita lokacin ƙirƙirar poller.  Wannan saitin zai shafi yawan lokutan da ake duba da sabunta pollers na nesa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Resource Cache Replication"
msgstr "Kashe Rarraba Kwafin Cache na Albarkatu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Cacti Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Cacti Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ta tsohuwa, babban Mai Tattara Bayanai na Cacti zai adana duka gidan yanar gizon da ƙarin manhajoji a cikin Rumbun Ajiyar Albarkatu. Sannan, lokaci zuwa lokaci Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa za su sabunta kansu da duk wani sabuntawa daga babban Mai Tattara Bayanai na Cacti. Wannan Rumbun Ajiyar Albarkatu yana ba wa Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa damar sabunta kansu da kansu. Idan ba ka son amfani da wannan zaɓin, za ka iya kashe shi ta amfani da wannan saitin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable Automatic Full Sync on Upgrade"
msgstr "Kashe Cikakken Daidaitawa na Kai-tsaye Yayin Sabuntawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, upon upgrading the Main Cacti system, it will perform a Full Sync to all Data Collectors.  This process may be time consuming.  Therefore, to allow upgrades to be completed quicker, we provide this option.  Note that if this is disabled, the Cacti administrator must force this process from the Data Collectors interface after upgrade."
msgstr "Ta tsohuwa, da zarar an sabunta Babban tsarin Cacti, zai yi Cikakken Daidaitawa zuwa duk Masu Tattara Bayanai. Wannan aikin na iya ɗaukar lokaci. Saboda haka, don ba da damar kammala sabuntawa da sauri, mun samar da wannan zaɓin. Ka lura cewa idan an kashe wannan, dole ne mai gudanarwa na Cacti ya tilasta wannan aikin daga shafin Masu Tattara Bayanai bayan sabuntawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Additional Data Collector Settings"
msgstr "Ƙarin Saitunan Mai Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Invalid Data Logging"
msgstr "Adana Rahoton Bayanan da Ba Su Dace Ba"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ta yaya kake son a adana rahoton kurakuran fitarwa na Mai Tattara Bayanai? Zaɓuɓɓuka sun haɗa da: 'Cikakke' wanda ke ba da cikakken bayani kan kowane kuskure, 'Taƙaitacce' wanda ke ba da adadin kurakuran fitarwa ga kowace Na'ura, da 'Babu', wanda ba ya ba da ƙidayar kurakurai."

