msgstr "Adadin ayyukan sabar rubutu masu gudana a lokaci guda ga kowane aikin spine. Ana karɓar saituna tsakanin 1 zuwa 15. Wannan siga zai taimaka idan kana gudanar da zaren ayyuka da yawa da rubuce-rubucen sabar rubutu kuma yana aiki ne kawai ga Mai Tattara Bayanai na spine."

