msgstr "Mafi girman lokacin da spine zai jira don rubutu ya kammala. Wannan ƙimar lokacin ƙarewa tana cikin daƙiƙa kuma tana aiki ga duka Masu Tattara Bayanai na cmd.php da spine."

#: include/global_settings.php
