#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On-demand RRD Update Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable On-demand RRD Updating"
msgstr "Kunna Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Shin Boost ya kunna sabunta RRD bisa buƙata a cikin Cacti? Idan ka kashe, wannan canjin ba zai fara aiki ba sai bayan zagayen tattara bayanai na gaba. Idan kana da Masu Tattara Bayanai na Nesa, ana buƙatar wannan saitin ya kasance a kunne."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Mai Sabunta RRD na Matakin Tsari"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Kafin a iya share Sabunta RRD Bisa Buƙata, dole ne gudanarwar poller ta wuce koyaushe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Sau Nawa Ya Kamata Boost Ya Sabunta Dukkan RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Lokacin da ka kunna Boost, ana sabunta fayilolin RRD naka ne kawai idan mai amfani ya buƙace su, ko kuma lokacin da wannan wa'adin lokaci ya cika."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Adadin Ayyukan Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Adadin ayyukan Boost masu gudana a lokaci guda da za a yi amfani da su don sarrafa dukkan RRD a cikin teburin Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Iyakar Adadin Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Idan teburin fitarwa na Boost ya wuce wannan adadi, a cikin bayanai, za a yi sabuntawa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Mafi Yawan Abubuwan Tushen Bayanai a Kowane Zagaye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Don inganta aiki, mai sabunta RRD na Boost yana buƙatar sanin adadin Abubuwan Tushen Bayanai da za a ɗauko a zagaye guda. Da fatan za a yi hankali kada a saita da yawa sosai domin aikin zana jadawali a lokacin manyan sabuntawa na iya raguwa. Idan ka fuskanci jinkirin zana jadawali ko tattara bayanai a lokacin sabuntawa, rage wannan lamba. Adadin asali shi ne 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Iyakar Tsawon Hujja"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Lokacin da Boost ke aika umarnin sabuntawa zuwa RRDtool, bai kamata ya wuce Iyakar Tsawon Hujja ta tsarin aiki ba. Wannan yana bambanta dangane da tsarin aiki da matakin kernel. Misali: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ babu iyaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Iyakar Ƙwaƙwalwar Ajiya don Boost da Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Mafi yawan adadin ƙwaƙwalwar ajiya don Poller na Cacti da Poller na Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Iyakar Lokacin Gudanar da Rubutun Sabunta RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Idan poller na Boost ya wuce wannan lokacin gudanarwa, za a sanya gargaɗi a cikin rajistar Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Boost Debugging"
msgstr "Kunna Binciken Kuskure na Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set, Boost will log debug information directly to the Boost log file.  Please note, enabling can cause a high I/O rate on the local file system."
msgstr "Idan aka saita, Boost zai rubuta bayanan binciken kuskure kai tsaye zuwa fayil ɗin rajistar Boost. A lura cewa kunnawa na iya haifar da yawan amfani da I/O a tsarin fayiloli na gida."

#: include/global_settings.php utilities.php
msgid "Image Caching"
msgstr "Ajiyar Hoto ta Wucin Gadi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Image Caching"
msgstr "Kunna Ajiyar Hoto ta Wucin Gadi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should image caching be enabled?"
msgstr "Shin a kunna ajiyar hoto ta wucin gadi?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Location for Image Files"
msgstr "Wurin Ajiye Fayilolin Hoto"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Specify the location where Boost should place your image files.  These files will be automatically purged by the poller when they expire."
msgstr "Ƙayyade wurin da ya kamata Boost ya sanya fayilolin hotonka. Poller zai share waɗannan fayiloli ta atomatik idan wa'adinsu ya ƙare."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Sources Statistics"
msgstr "Ƙididdigar Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Data Source Statistics Collection"
msgstr "Kunna Tattara Ƙididdigar Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Data Source Statistics be collected for this Cacti system?"
msgstr "Shin a tattara Ƙididdigar Tushen Bayanai don wannan tsarin Cacti?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Tattara Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics can use a legacy method where it will determine peak and average values, or an advanced mode which will calculated several additional statistical values in addition to peak and average.  Using All Statistical Metrics can place additional CPU and IO load on the system."
msgstr "Ƙididdigar Tushen Bayanai na iya amfani da tsohuwar hanya inda za ta ƙayyade ƙimar ƙololuwa da matsakaici, ko yanayin ci gaba wanda zai lissafa ƙarin ƙididdiga masu yawa ban da ƙololuwa da matsakaici. Yin amfani da Dukkan Ma'aunin Ƙididdiga na iya ƙara nauyin CPU da IO a kan tsarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Peak/Average Only"
msgstr "Ƙololuwa/Matsakaici Kawai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "All Statistical Metrics"
msgstr "Dukkan Ma'aunin Ƙididdiga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Calculate Peaks Stats in Addition to Average Stats"
msgstr "Lissafa Ƙididdigar Ƙololuwa Baya ga Ƙididdigar Matsakaici"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This option will double the data collection time.  If will use the MAX consolidation function and calculate statistics from the max values in each of the respective time ranges."
msgstr "Wannan zaɓin zai ninka lokacin tattara bayanai sau biyu. Zai yi amfani da aikin haɗawa na MAX kuma ya lissafa ƙididdiga daga ƙimomin mafi girma a kowane ɗayan lokutan da aka ƙayyade."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of DSStats Processes"
msgstr "Adadin Ayyukan DSStats"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent DSStats processes to use to use to process all of the Data Sources."
msgstr "Adadin ayyukan DSStats masu gudana a lokaci guda da za a yi amfani da su don sarrafa dukkan Tushen Bayanai."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Update Frequency"
msgstr "Yawan Sabuntawa na Kullum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How frequent should Daily Stats be updated?"
msgstr "Sau nawa ya kamata a riƙa sabunta ƙididdigar yau da kullum?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hourly Average Window"
msgstr "Tagar Matsakaicin Sa'o'i"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of consecutive hours that represent the hourly average.  Keep in mind that a setting too high can result in very large memory tables"
msgstr "Adadin sa'o'i masu biye da juna da ke wakiltar matsakaicin sa'a. Ka tuna cewa saiti mai yawa sosai zai iya haifar da manyan teburorin ƙwaƙwalwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maintenance Time"
msgstr "Lokacin Kulawa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "What time of day should Weekly, Monthly, and Yearly Data be updated?  Format is HH:MM [am/pm]"
msgstr "Wane lokaci na rana ya kamata a sabunta bayanan mako-mako, wata-wata, da shekara-shekara? Tsarin shi ne HH:MM [am/pm]"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Data Source Statistics Data Collector"
msgstr "Iyakar Ƙwaƙwalwa ga Mai Tara Bayanan Ƙididdigar Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Data Source Statistics Poller"
msgstr "Matsakaicin adadin ƙwaƙwalwa ga mai bincike na Cacti da mai binciken ƙididdigar tushen bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Retention Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Riƙe Tushen Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Save Historical Data in Database Tables"
msgstr "Ajiye Tsofaffin Bayanai a cikin Teburorin Rumbun Bayanai"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this setting in order to keep a table for each day, week, month, and year data.  The times that these tables will be created will be based upon the following formula: Daily - One partition per day, Weekly - One Partition per Week, Monthly - One partition per Month, Yearly - One Partition per Year.  All tables will have the following suffixes by type Daily: YYYYDDD, Weekly: YYYYWW, Monthly: YYYYMM, and Yearly: YYYY suffixes."
msgstr "Zaɓi wannan saitin domin ajiye tebur don bayanan kowace rana, mako, wata, da shekara. Za a ƙirƙiri waɗannan teburorin bisa ga tsari mai zuwa: Kullum - Sashe ɗaya a kowace rana, Mako-mako - Sashe ɗaya a kowane mako, Wata-wata - Sashe ɗaya a kowane wata, Shekara-shekara - Sashe ɗaya a kowace shekara. Dukkan teburori za su kasance da waɗannan ƙarin haruffan ƙarshe bisa nau'i: Kullum: YYYYDDD, Mako-mako: YYYYWW, Wata-wata: YYYYMM, da Shekara-shekara: YYYY."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Daily Partition Retention"
msgstr "Riƙe Sashen Kullum"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of Days, Weeks, Months, or Years to keep daily statistics."
msgstr "Adadin kwanaki, makonni, watanni, ko shekaru da za a riƙe ƙididdigar kullum."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Weekly Partition Retention"
msgstr "Riƙe Sashen Mako-mako"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of Days, Weeks, Months, or Years to keep weekly statistics."
msgstr "Adadin kwanaki, makonni, watanni, ko shekaru da za a riƙe ƙididdigar mako-mako."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Monthly Partition Retention"
msgstr "Riƙe Sashen Wata-wata"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of Days, Weeks, Months, or Years to keep monthly statistics."
msgstr "Adadin kwanaki, makonni, watanni, ko shekaru da za a riƙe ƙididdigar wata-wata."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Yearly Partition Retention"
msgstr "Riƙe Sashen Shekara-shekara"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of Days, Weeks, Months, or Years to keep yearly statistics."
msgstr "Adadin kwanaki, makonni, watanni, ko shekaru da za a riƙe ƙididdigar shekara-shekara."

