#: user_admin.php
msgid "Local"
msgstr "Na Gida"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server"
msgstr "Sabar Wakili ta RRDtool"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Structure RRDfile Paths"
msgstr "Tsara Hanyoyin Fayilolin RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Structured Paths"
msgstr "Kunna Tsarin Hanyoyi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Use a separate subfolder for each hosts RRD files.  The naming of the RRDfiles will be one of the following:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>You can make this change after install by running the CLI script <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> after you make the change.  NOTE: If you change Max Directories value to decrease the number of directories, or if you change the Directory Pattern, empty directories will not be pruned after you rerun the <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> script."
msgstr "Yi amfani da ƙaramin babban fayil na daban ga fayilolin RRD na kowace na'urar sadarwa. Sanya sunan fayilolin RRD zai zama ɗaya daga cikin waɗannan:<br><ul><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/host_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/local_data_id.rrd,</li><li>&lt;path_cacti&gt;/rra/device_hash/device_id/data_query_id/local_data_id.rrd.</li></ul><br>Za ka iya yin wannan sauyi bayan shigarwa ta hanyar gudanar da rubutun CLI <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b> bayan ka yi sauyin. LURA: Idan ka sauya ƙimar Matsakaicin Jakunkunan Fayiloli don rage adadin jakunkunan fayiloli, ko idan ka sauya Tsarin Jakar Fayil, ba za a share jakunkunan fayiloli marasa komai ba bayan ka sake gudanar da rubutun <b>structure_rra_paths.php</b>."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Directory Pattern"
msgstr "Tsarin Jakar Fayil"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Which Directory Pattern do you wish to use for Structured RRD Paths.  'Device ID' is the default.  The setting 'Device ID/Data Query ID' should be used when you have Devices with thousands of Graphs.  After Changing the Directory Pattern, you must run the Structured Path CLI script again to modify the RRDfile paths to the new Pattern."
msgstr "Wane Tsarin Jakar Fayil kake son amfani da shi don Hanyoyin RRD Masu Tsari. 'ID na Na'ura' shi ne na asali. Ya kamata a yi amfani da saitin 'ID na Na'ura/ID na Tambayar Bayanai' idan kana da na'urori masu dubban zane-zane. Bayan sauya Tsarin Jakar Fayil, dole ne ka sake gudanar da rubutun CLI na Tsarin Hanyoyi don gyara hanyoyin fayilolin RRD zuwa sabon tsarin."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device ID"
msgstr "ID na Na'ura"

