msgstr "Sabar Wakili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Sunan uwar garken DNS ko adireshin IP na sabar wakili ta RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Proxy Port Number"
msgstr "Lambar Tashar Wakili"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "Tashar TCP don sadarwa mai rufaffen sirri."

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "Sawun Yatsan RSA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Sawun yatsan maɓallin RSA na jama'a na yanzu da sabar wakili ke amfani da shi. Ana buƙatar wannan don kafa haɗi amintacce."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "Sabar Wakili ta RRDtool - Ajiyar Madadi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Daidaita Nauyi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Idan duka sabar wakili ta asali da ta ajiyar madadi suna samuwa, wannan zaɓin yana ba da damar rarraba dukkan buƙatun zuwa RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Sunan uwar garken DNS ko adireshin IP na sabar wakili ta ajiyar madadi ta RRDtool idan sabar wakilin tana aiki a yanayin MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "Tashar TCP don sadarwa mai rufaffen sirri da sabar wakili ta ajiyar madadi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Sawun yatsan maɓallin RSA na jama'a na yanzu da sabar wakili ta ajiyar madadi ke amfani da shi. Ana buƙatar wannan don kafa haɗi amintacce."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Saitunan Kashe Kololuwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Cirewa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin cirewa guda biyu. Ta farko, Madaidaicin Karkacewa, za ta cire duk wani samfurin da ke da nisan adadin X na madaidaicin karkacewa daga matsakaicin samfuran."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Madaidaicin Karkacewa"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Hanyar Maye Gurbi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Akwai hanyoyin maye gurbi guda uku. Hanyar farko tana maye gurbin ƙaruwar ba-zata da matsakaicin tushen bayanan da abin ya shafa. Hanya ta biyu tana maye gurbin ƙaruwar ba-zata da 'NaN'. Ta ƙarshe tana maye gurbin ƙaruwar ba-zata da ƙima mai kyau ta ƙarshe da aka samu."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
