#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Idan na'urorinka suna buƙatar a fara amfani da wani saitin zaɓuɓɓuka daban, za ka iya ayyana su a ƙasa kuma za a yi amfani da su kafin na asali"

