#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Ba a ba da shawarar sabunta Samfuran da ka riga ka yi gyare-gyare a kansu ba. Haɓaka Samfuran BA zai cire gyare-gyaren da aka yi wa Samfuran Zana-zane da na Bayanai ba, kuma yana iya haifar da yanayin da ba a yi tsammani ba. Duk da haka, idan ba ka yi canje-canje ga kowane Zana-zane, Tambayar Bayanai, ko Samfurin Bayanai ba, sake shigo da Kunshin bai kamata ya yi wani tasiri ba. A wannan yanayin, za ka buƙaci danna 'Sync Graphs' daga Samfuran bayan sabuntawa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
