#: login_providers.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Jerin sunayen gida na DNS ko adiresoshin IP da aka raba da sarari don sahihan sabobin LDAP. Cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin amfani da sabobin LDAP daga hagu zuwa dama don tantance mai amfani.<br><br>Don shiga da Kalmar Sirri ta Lokaci Ɗaya (OTP/MFA), kada ku yi amfani da jerin sabobi da yawa da aka raba da sarari. Idan haɗin bind ya gaza, Cacti yana wucewa zuwa saba na gaba kuma ya sake haɗawa da bayanai iri ɗaya, kuma za a ƙi lambar lokaci ɗaya da aka riga aka yi amfani da ita. Maimakon haka, shigar da sunan DNS guda ɗaya mai ƙarfi wanda na'urar raba nauyi ta DNS (VIP) ke jagoranta ta yadda za a kula da sauyawa idan saba ta faɗi a ƙarƙashin Cacti kuma haɗin tantancewa guda ɗaya ne kawai za a taɓa yi."

