msgstr "Yanayi"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Mode which cacti will attempt to authenticate against the LDAP server.<blockquote><i>No Searching</i> - No Distinguished Name (DN) searching occurs, just attempt to bind with the provided Distinguished Name (DN) format.<br><br><i>Anonymous Searching</i> - Attempts to search for username against LDAP directory via anonymous binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>Specific Searching</i> - Attempts search for username against LDAP directory via Specific Distinguished Name (DN) and Specific Password for binding to locate the users Distinguished Name (DN).<br><br><i>One-Time Passwords (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti binds the user password only once, during final authentication.  <i>No Searching</i> performs no directory lookup and binds directly using the Distinguished Name (DN) template, so it is safe for OTP when the DN template alone identifies the user.  When a directory lookup is required to resolve the DN, use <i>Specific Searching</i> with a dedicated service account (or <i>Anonymous Searching</i> where the directory permits it) so the lookup never consumes the single-use code.  For resilient OTP deployments use a single DNS load balancer name in the Server(s) field rather than a space delimited multi-server list, which would re-attempt the bind with an already-consumed one-time password."
msgstr "Yanayin da Cacti zai yi ƙoƙarin tantancewa da uwar garken LDAP.<blockquote><i>Babu Bincike</i> - Ba za a yi binciken Distinguished Name (DN) ba, sai dai kawai a yi ƙoƙarin haɗawa da tsarin Distinguished Name (DN) da aka bayar.<br><br><i>Bincike Ba Tare da Suna Ba</i> - Yana ƙoƙarin bincika sunan mai amfani a cikin kundin adireshin LDAP ta hanyar haɗawa ba tare da bayyana suna ba don gano Distinguished Name (DN) na mai amfani.<br><br><i>Takamaiman Bincike</i> - Yana ƙoƙarin bincika sunan mai amfani a cikin kundin adireshin LDAP ta hanyar Takamaiman Distinguished Name (DN) da Takamaiman Kalmar Sirri don haɗawa domin gano Distinguished Name (DN) na mai amfani.<br><br><i>Kalmomin Sirri na Lokaci Ɗaya (OTP/MFA)</i> - Cacti yana haɗa kalmar sirrin mai amfani sau ɗaya kacal, a lokacin tantancewa ta ƙarshe. <i>Babu Bincike</i> ba ya yin bincike a cikin kundin adireshi kuma yana haɗawa kai tsaye ta amfani da samfurin Distinguished Name (DN), don haka yana da aminci ga OTP idan samfurin DN kaɗai ya isa ya bayyana mai amfani. Lokacin da ake buƙatar binciken kundin adireshi don gano DN, a yi amfani da <i>Takamaiman Bincike</i> tare da asusun sabis na musamman (ko <i>Bincike Ba Tare da Suna Ba</i> inda kundin adireshin ya ba da izini) domin binciken kada ya cinye lambar amfani sau ɗaya. Don tsarin OTP mai juriya, a yi amfani da sunan mai daidaita nauyi na DNS guda ɗaya a cikin filin Server(s) maimakon jerin sabobin da aka raba da sarari, wanda zai sake gwada haɗawa da kalmar sirri ta lokaci ɗaya da aka riga aka yi amfani da ita."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Distinguished Name (DN)"
msgstr "Fitaccen Suna (DN)"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "The \"Distinguished Name\" syntax, applicable for both OpenLDAP and Windows AD configurations, offers flexibility in defining user identity. For OpenLDAP, the format follows this structure: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD provides an alternative syntax: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, commonly known as \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". In this context, \"&lt;username&gt;\" represents the specific username provided during the login prompt. This is particularly pertinent when operating in \"No Searching\" mode, or \"Require Group Membership\" enabled."
msgstr "Tsarin \"Fitaccen Suna\", wanda ya dace da saitunan OpenLDAP da Windows AD duka, yana ba da sauƙi wajen ayyana asalin mai amfani. Ga OpenLDAP, tsarin yana bin wannan tsari: <i>\"uid=&lt;username&gt;,ou=people,dc=domain,dc=local\"</i>. Windows AD yana ba da wani tsari na daban: <i>\"&lt;username&gt;@win2kdomain.local\"</i>, wanda aka fi sani da \"userPrincipalName (UPN)\". A cikin wannan mahallin, \"&lt;username&gt;\" yana wakiltar takamaiman sunan mai amfani da aka bayar yayin shiga. Wannan yana da muhimmanci musamman idan ana aiki a yanayin \"Ba Bincike\", ko idan an kunna \"Buƙatar Kasancewa Mamba a Ƙungiya\"."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"
msgstr "uid=<username>,ou=people,dc=example,dc=com"

