msgstr "Cire wannan Plugin ɗin na iya goge dukkan Bayanai da Saitunan Plugin. Idan kana so da gaske ka Cire Plugin ɗin, danna 'Cirewa' a ƙasa. In ba haka ba danna 'Soke'."

#: plugins.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to Uninstall?"
msgstr "Shin kun tabbata kuna son cirewa?"

#: plugins.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to Force Uninstall?"
msgstr "Shin kun tabbata kuna son tilasta cirewa?"

#: plugins.php
msgid "The directory for this Plugin is missing, so it can not be uninstalled normally.  Force Uninstall permanently removes all of its entries from the Cacti plugin tables (configuration, hooks, permissions, and any tables or columns it created).  This can not be undone.  If you really want to Force Uninstall the Plugin, click 'Force Uninstall' below.  Otherwise click 'Cancel'."
msgstr "Jakar fayilolin wannan ƙarin manhaja ta ɓace, don haka ba za a iya cire shi ta hanyar al'ada ba. Tilasta Cirewa yana share dukkan bayanansa har abada daga teburan ƙare-ƙaren manhaja na Cacti (saituna, ƙugiyoyin haɗi, izini, da duk wani teburi ko ginshiƙi da ya ƙirƙira). Ba za a iya dawo da wannan ba. Idan da gaske kuna son Tilasta Cire ƙarin manhajar, ku danna 'Tilasta Cirewa' a ƙasa. In ba haka ba, ku danna 'Soke'."

#: plugins.php
msgid "Force Uninstall"
msgstr "Tilasta Cirewa"

#: plugins.php
msgid "Removing Plugin Data and Settings for will remove all Plugin Data and Settings.  If you really want to Remove Data and Settings for this Plugin, click 'Remove Data' below.  Otherwise click 'Cancel'."
msgstr "Cire Bayanai da Saitunan Ƙarin Manhaja zai share dukkan Bayanai da Saitunan Ƙarin Manhaja. Idan da gaske kuna son Cire Bayanai da Saituna na wannan ƙarin manhaja, ku danna 'Cire Bayanai' a ƙasa. In ba haka ba, ku danna 'Soke'."

#: plugins.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to Remove all Plugin Data and Settings?"
msgstr "Shin kun tabbata kuna son cire dukkan bayanai da saitunan ƙarin manhaja?"

#: plugins.php
msgid "Restoring this Plugin Archive will overwrite the current Plugin directory.  If you really want to Restore this Plugin Archive, click 'Restore' below.  Otherwise click 'Cancel'."
msgstr "Maido da wannan Rumbun Ajiyar Ƙarin Manhaja zai maye gurbin jakar fayilolin ƙarin manhaja ta yanzu. Idan da gaske kuna son Maido da wannan Rumbun Ajiyar Ƙarin Manhaja, ku danna 'Maido' a ƙasa. In ba haka ba, ku danna 'Soke'."

#: plugins.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to Restore this Archive?"
msgstr "Shin kun tabbata kuna son maido da wannan rumbun ajiyar?"

#: plugins.php
msgid "Deleting this Plugin Archive is not reversible without a table restore.  If you really want to Delete the Plugin Archive, click 'Delete' below.  Otherwise click 'Cancel'."
msgstr "Share wannan Rumbun Ajiyar Ƙarin Manhaja ba zai yiwu a mayar da shi ba sai dai ta hanyar maido da teburi. Idan da gaske kuna son Share Rumbun Ajiyar Ƙarin Manhaja, ku danna 'Share' a ƙasa. In ba haka ba, ku danna 'Soke'."

#: plugins.php
msgid "Are you sure you want to Delete this Archive?"
msgstr "Shin kun tabbata kuna son share wannan rumbun ajiyar?"

#: plugins.php
msgid "Archiving makes a backup of the plugin that you may restore at a later date.  Before archiving, you may enter an archive note that will be stored with the Archive for later reference.  If you really want to Archive the Plugin, click 'Delete' below.  Otherwise click 'Cancel'."
msgstr "Ajiyewa a rumbun ajiya yana yin kwafin ajiyar ƙarin manhajar da za ku iya maidowa a wata rana. Kafin ajiyewa, za ku iya shigar da bayanin rumbun ajiya wanda za a adana tare da rumbun ajiyar don tunani a gaba. Idan da gaske kuna son Ajiye Ƙarin Manhajar, ku danna 'Share' a ƙasa. In ba haka ba, ku danna 'Soke'."

